    oe:answerText "Screening for, and treating, Helicobacter pylori in the general population or patients with early gastric neoplasia could reduce incidence of, and mortality from, gastric cancer. We updated a meta-analysis of randomized controlled trials (RCTs) examining this issue."^^xsd:string ;
